@host = http://localhost:8081
@embeddingService = http://127.0.0.1:8001
@profileId = 1
@limit = 20

### Embedding service health
GET {{embeddingService}}/health

### Embedding service model info
GET {{embeddingService}}/model-info

### Embeddings status
GET {{host}}/internal/embeddings/status

### Prepare job embeddings metadata
POST {{host}}/internal/embeddings/backfill/jobs?limit=100

### Prepare profile embeddings metadata
POST {{host}}/internal/embeddings/backfill/profiles?limit=100

### Prepare one profile embedding metadata
POST {{host}}/internal/embeddings/profiles/{{profileId}}/prepare

### Process pending BGE-M3 embeddings
POST {{host}}/internal/embeddings/process/bge-m3/pending?limit=5

### Raw vector search with real model
GET {{host}}/internal/embeddings/vector-search/profiles/{{profileId}}/jobs?limit={{limit}}&embeddingModel=BAAI/bge-m3

### Vector-first compatibility diagnostic
GET {{host}}/internal/analysis/profiles/{{profileId}}/vector-first-compatibility?limit={{limit}}
